Previous Lessons:
1. Alloy syntax requires global relations to be declared within signatures; attempting to declare global mutable relations with `var` outside signatures causes syntax errors blocking all verification.
2. - Syntax errors in relational navigation using incorrect set comprehension block all verification; relational dot notation is the Alloy standard and critical for progress.
